<title>USA: BPA offers 200 MW peak firm power for Friday.</title>
<headline>BPA offers 200 MW peak firm power for Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) offered 200 megawatts of peak firm power for Friday, after staying out of the surplus power market for today's deliveries, the agency said Thursday.</p>
<p>BPA offered the peak firm sales at $18.00 for Northwest deliveries and $20.00 for California-Oregon border (COB) sales.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau +1 213 955 6761))</p>
